          </span>
        </div>
        <div className="flex items-center space-x-6">
          <div className="flex items-center text-[#67df70] text-[12px] space-x-2">
            <span className="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#67df70] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(103,223,112,0.6)]"></span>
            <span>Online</span>
